<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-2954] Read-through doesn&apos;t work for OFFHEAP_TIRED when eviction or expire policy is used</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-2954</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;IgniteCacheReadThroughEvictionOffheapTiredSelfTest&lt;/tt&gt; fails for several test cases.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In general we have to add all possible permutations to validate that the read-through works fine for cases when an entry is evicted/removed :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;expire policy;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;eviction policy;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;remove.withSkipStore()&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
